mcp-privacy-guard bundles the following third-party data.

Public Suffix List
  File: engine/src/mcp_privacy_guard/data/public_suffix_list.dat
  Source: https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
  Licence: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/)
  Refreshed with scripts/update-public-suffix.sh.

Common words
  File: engine/src/mcp_privacy_guard/data/common_words.txt
  Source: the first 5,000 entries of google-10000-english-no-swears.txt
  (https://github.com/first20hours/google-10000-english), derived from the Google Web
  Trillion Word Corpus (Brants and Franz, distributed by the LDC; subsets by Peter Norvig,
  MIT licence), filtered to entries that are lower-case words of the system dictionary
  (so no proper nouns) with at least three letters, plus a few networking terms.
  Licence note: the upstream states "educational and personal/research use ... is permitted
  under the LDC license, Norvig's MIT license for his contributions, and US fair use
  doctrine". The list is word frequency data, not text. Confirm that this is acceptable
  before publishing the repository.
